% expect-output: 5.0
% expect-output: 0.0
% divergence: resident-inventory
% Scenario: a missing glyph advances by notdef. Palatino-Roman
% re-encoded with code 65 as a name the face lacks advances by the
% face's .notdef width, 500 from its metric table; at size 10 the
% stringwidth of that code is 5.
% Expect: 5.0 and 0.0.
/r { 1000 mul round 1000 div } def
/P2 /Palatino-Roman findfont dup length dict copy
  dup /Encoding StandardEncoding dup length array copy
  dup 65 /nosuchglyph put put definefont pop
/P2 findfont 10 scalefont setfont
(A) stringwidth r exch r = =
